{"id": "EUVD-2025-211171", "enisaUuid": "4a3a01a5-54d9-3c3f-8e31-a77fe8b03ea3", "description": "Weaver E-cology 8.0, 9.0, and 10.0 prior to 10.76 contains an unauthenticated SQL injection vulnerability in the /api/doc/out/more/list endpoint via the elementmore parameter with srcType=2. Attackers can inject SQL through doc_datefrom/doc_dateto fields and read results via /api/ec/dev/table/counts to extract database information. Exploitation evidence was first observed by the Shadowserver Foundation on 2026-07-19.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T10:57:38", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T10:57:38", "baseScore": 8.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://y4tacker.github.io/2025/07/09/year/2025/07/%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E4%BB%8E%E7%81%B0%E7%9B%92%E8%A7%92%E5%BA%A6%E5%BF%AB%E9%80%9F%E5%A4%8D%E7%8E%B0Weaver-SQL%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5/", "https://1diot9.github.io/2026/05/13/%E6%B3%9B%E5%BE%AEe9%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E6%80%9D%E8%B7%AF/", "https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/vulnerabilities/weaver/weaver-ecology9-doc-list-sqli.yaml", "https://blog.csdn.net/murphysec/article/details/149236904", "https://www.weaver.com.cn/cs/security/edm20250704_opiurutjvmopimdwytdc.html", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/weaver-e-cology-10.76-unauthenticated-sql-injection-via-doc-out-more-list"], "aliases": ["CVE-2025-71434", "GHSA-gqhm-9jqr-x4r6"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "f2761743-8f87-351b-b998-6a280e71c238", "product": {"name": "e-cology", "vendor": {"name": "Weaver Network Co., Ltd."}}, "product_version": "0 <10.76"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "0edc6db4-2119-3f06-aa11-a92a7ac2f596", "vendor": {"name": "Weaver Network Co., Ltd."}}], "isExploited": false}